    challengesLabel: THE CHALLENGES
    challenge: '<p data-end="147" data-start="0">Dashboard customization: creation of KPIs and reports tailored to Cro’vettes’ specific needs (production, sales, inventory, and margin tracking).</p><p data-end="241" data-start="149">IoT connection: integration of terminals to streamline data entry and reduce human errors.</p><p data-end="402" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" data-start="243">Integration of the Point of Sale (POS) with inventory management and accounting: real-time synchronization between in-store sales, e-commerce, and back-office.</p>'
    solutionLabel: THE SOLUTION
    solution: '<p data-end="198" data-start="0">Complete customization: The ERP was adapted to Cro’vettes’ artisanal methods, featuring tailored product management, optimized invoicing, and a personalized dashboard for better delivery tracking.</p><p data-end="389" data-start="200">Process optimization: Improved inventory visibility, automation of promotions through POS and IoT, simplified payment management via Stripe, and an intuitive interface for quick adoption.</p><p data-end="513" data-start="391">Expert support: Agitech provided continuous follow-up with fast responses, training sessions, and on-site installations.</p><p data-end="624" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="" data-start="515">Performance and ROI: Digitalization reduced errors, increased productivity, and improved operational control.</p>'
